:: Widgets MP NPC Ash [widget nobr]
<<widget "mpInitNpcAsh">>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs>><<set $mpNpcs to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.ash>><<set $mpNpcs.ash to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, axis: 0, axisLabel: "火种", firewood: 0, campTier: 0, patrolRoute: "none", deepStage: 0, emberPages: 0, nextStepDay: 0, setback: 0, rep: 50, weekKey: -1, upkeepWeek: -1, relDay: 0 }>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.ash.axis is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.ash.axis to 0>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.ash.axisLabel>><<set $mpNpcs.ash.axisLabel to "火种">><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.ash.firewood is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.ash.firewood to 0>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.ash.campTier is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.ash.campTier to 0>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.ash.patrolRoute>><<set $mpNpcs.ash.patrolRoute to "none">><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.ash.deepStage is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.ash.deepStage to 0>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.ash.emberPages is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.ash.emberPages to 0>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.ash.nextStepDay is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.ash.nextStepDay to 0>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.ash.setback is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.ash.setback to 0>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.ash.rep is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.ash.rep to 50>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.ash.weekKey is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.ash.weekKey to -1>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.ash.upkeepWeek is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.ash.upkeepWeek to -1>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.ash.relDay is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.ash.relDay to 0>><</if>>
<</widget>>

:: MP NPC Ash Deep Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcAsh>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>>
<<if !$mpAshEnded and $mpWorldAshEnding>><<set $mpAshEnded to 1>><</if>>
<<if $mpWorldAshEnding is "beacon">><<set _wk to Math.floor(Time.days / 7)>><<if (_npc.upkeepWeek or 0) isnot _wk>><<set _npc.upkeepWeek to _wk>><<money -20>><</if>><</if>>
<<mpInitNpcCross>>
火塘烧到第三块松柴时，<<if _npc.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守林人<</if>>从北面雾里走出来，把湿柴卸在石圈外，抹掉眉骨水珠后把油布旧册摊在石台上。册页记着火种 <<print _npc.axis>>、干柴 <<print _npc.firewood>> 份与余烬残页 <<print (_npc.emberPages or 0)>> 页。<<if $mpNpcCrossLast and $mpNpcCrossLast.ash>>册页边角还夹着一张便签，记着「<<print $mpNpcCrossLast.ash>>」。<<else>>猎犬趴在火塘边，耳朵朝向林道。<</if>><<if $mpWorldAshEnding is "beacon">>北岭石塔长明不熄，每周要从账上支一笔松脂油钱。<<elseif $mpWorldAshEnding is "hidden">>高坡石塔已经封死，巡山只走地下暗哨，白昼收柴比从前少一成。<<else>>第七盏灯的位置还空着。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回身边 (0:02)|MP NPC Ash Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpclockworkicon>><<link [[查看作息表 (0:06)|MP NPC Ash Schedule]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[查看巡林路线 (0:10)|MP NPC Ash Loop]]>><<pass 10>><</link>><br>
<<shopicon>><<link [[查看营地阶位 (0:08)|MP NPC Ash Subsys]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><br>
<<if Time.days lt (_npc.setback or 0)>>
<<link [[查看休整木牌 (0:04)|MP NPC Ash Quest Closed]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<elseif $mpAshEnded>>
<<if $mpWorldAshEnding is "hidden">><<link [[重温暗哨终局 (0:08)|MP NPC Ash Ending B]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><<else>><<link [[重温烽火终局 (0:08)|MP NPC Ash Ending A]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><</if>>
<<else>>
<<link [[去他现在所在 (0:05)|MP NPC Ash Schedule]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP NPC Ash Quest Waiting [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcAsh>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>>
石屋外的风灯压得很低。<<if _npc.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守林人<</if>>看了一眼天色与油布册，把骨刀插回腰间，说今天进不得北岭旧灯道：山间只在白昼六点至十八点看得出旧油迹，每走一步都得隔天等风向稳下来。<<if (_npc.emberPages or 0) lt 6 and (_npc.deepStage or 0) lt 5>>册里的余烬残页只凑了 <<print (_npc.emberPages or 0)>> 页，还得靠每周巡林结算一页页补齐。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回火种深枢 (0:03)|MP NPC Ash Deep Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<mplettericon>><<link [[明天再来问一次 (0:06)|MP NPC Ash Deep Hub]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Ash Quest Closed [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcAsh>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>>
火塘边的油布棚落下了半扇木挡，界石上挂着「封山休整」的炭牌。<<if _npc.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守林人<</if>>正在棚下重绑磨断的麻绳，隔着烟气朝你摇了摇头：上次在旧灯道失手惊动了林场巡哨，还折损了一份干柴与声望，这两天北岭风口不能露面，过两天风声松了再来。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回火种深枢 (0:03)|MP NPC Ash Deep Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[过两天再来看看 (0:06)|MP NPC Ash Deep Hub]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Ash Tier Action [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcAsh>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>>
火塘里的松柴发出低沉的爆裂声，<<if _npc.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守林人<</if>>把铁壶架上石圈。眼下火种刻度停在 <<print _npc.axis>>，<<if _npc.axis gte 60 and (_npc.love or 0) gte 20>>他已经把备用灯钩与北坡暗哨的火摺子都放在你随手能取到的石槽里<<elseif _npc.axis gte 25 or (_npc.trust or 0) gte 10>>他递过热水时会顺口告诉你哪段林道背风、哪块界石松动<<else>>他话仍不多，但已经在火塘边给你留了一块干爽的青石座<</if>>。
松针上的雨珠顺着树皮滑落，火塘里的余烬在山风里一明一暗。<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回深枢 (0:02)|MP NPC Ash Deep Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[围火寒暄近况 (0:08)|MP NPC Ash Deep Hub]]>><<pass 8>><<if !$daily.mpAshTierTalk>><<set $daily.mpAshTierTalk to 1>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, _npc.axis + 3)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>><<stress -2>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[深谈旧灯道渊源 (0:12)|MP NPC Ash Deep Hub]]>><<pass 12>><<if _npc.axis gte 15 or (_npc.trust or 0) gte 5>><<if !$daily.mpAshTierDeep>><<set $daily.mpAshTierDeep to 1>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, _npc.axis + 6)>><<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 2)>><<stress -4>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><<else>><<stress 2>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mphiveicon>><<link [[陪他封存老松脂膏 (0:10)|MP NPC Ash Daily 15]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Ash Loop [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcAsh>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>>
<<if $mpNpcLoopDay_ash isnot Time.days>><<set $mpNpcLoopDay_ash to Time.days>><<set $mpNpcLoopLock_ash to "none">><</if>>
石台上摊着巡林路标图，当前干柴存有 <<print _npc.firewood>> 份，雾潮水尺 <<print ($mpFogTide or 0)>> 格。<<if _npc.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守林人<</if>>用炭笔标出三条路线：北岭风口耗时短但山风刺骨，深谷暗哨省力却要与走私脚夫交涉。本轮路线<<if $mpNpcLoopLock_ash is "north">>已锁定北岭，其余路线被山雾封死<<elseif $mpNpcLoopLock_ash is "valley">>已锁定深谷，北岭风口已起狂风<<elseif $mpNpcLoopLock_ash is "bridge">>已锁定断桥旧道，南北两条山径都已落锁<<else>>尚未锁死，选定一条便会关掉另外两条<</if>>。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回深枢 (0:02)|MP NPC Ash Deep Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpclimbicon>><<link [[巡北岭高风口 (0:15)|MP NPC Ash Loop North]]>><<pass 15>><</link>><br>
<<mpveilicon>><<link [[探深谷走私暗哨 (0:15)|MP NPC Ash Loop Valley]]>><<pass 15>><</link>><br>
<<if !$daily.mpLoopThirdAsh and $mpNpcLoopLock_ash is "none">>
<<mpropeicon>><<link [[走断桥旧道收干柴 (0:15)|MP NPC Ash Loop Resolve]]>><<pass 15>><<set $daily.mpLoopThirdAsh to 1>><<set $mpNpcLoopLock_ash to "bridge">><<set _npc.patrolRoute to "bridge">><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP NPC Ash Loop North [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcAsh>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>>
<<if $mpNpcLoopLock_ash is "none">>
<<set $mpNpcLoopLock_ash to "north">><<set _npc.patrolRoute to "north">><<set _freshAshNorth to 1>>
北岭风口刮得脸颊生疼，深谷小径已被落石封断。阿什顶风按住灯罩，指你看崖边折断的干松枝与冻僵的灯座：高坡收柴最快，每一步却要双倍体力，靴底还直打滑。
<<elseif $mpNpcLoopLock_ash is "north">>
这条风口今天已经走过，阿什把炭笔收回皮囊：同一个风口一天只攀一回，再上去只会把腿脚和灯油一起耗空。他压低风灯，示意你先回岔口歇口气，别硬撑着再爬。
<<else>>
北岭风口已被倒灌的冰雾封死，阿什拽住你的背包带让你退回岔口。今日既然已走了另一条山径，这边的风向标早已结冰锁死，强闯只会白白滑下碎石坡。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回总图 (0:02)|MP NPC Ash Loop]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<if _freshAshNorth is 1>>
<<mpcarryicon>><<link [[顶狂风收干松柴 (0:14)|MP NPC Ash Loop Resolve]]>><<pass 14>><<if !$daily.mpAshLoopNorthAct>><<set $daily.mpAshLoopNorthAct to 1>><<tiredness 3>><<pain 1>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, (_npc.axis or 0) + 4)>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mplampicon>><<link [[顶风重燃崖顶风灯 (0:16)|MP NPC Ash Loop Resolve]]>><<pass 16>><<if !$daily.mpAshLoopNorthAct>><<set $daily.mpAshLoopNorthAct to 1>><<tiredness 4>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, (_npc.axis or 0) + 6)>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><</link>>
<<else>>
<<walkicon>><<link [[查看封锁代价 (0:06)|MP NPC Ash Loop Lockout]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP NPC Ash Loop Valley [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcAsh>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>>
<<if $mpNpcLoopLock_ash is "none">>
<<set $mpNpcLoopLock_ash to "valley">><<set _npc.patrolRoute to "valley">><<set _freshAshValley to 1>>
深谷暗哨笼在背风浓雾里，北岭山径同日已被寒潮封锁。阿什压低风灯，与窝棚里的走私脚夫对过手势：谷底换柴省力，脚夫的油布包里却难免混着来路不明的火器印记。
<<elseif $mpNpcLoopLock_ash is "valley">>
这条深谷暗哨今天已经探过，阿什把风灯罩扣回腰间：脚夫们一夜只做一趟买卖，再下去也只剩空窝棚和满地踩烂的松针。他示意你退回岔口，等明日雾散再换路线。
<<else>>
深谷暗哨的吊桥已被对岸脚夫拉起，阿什停在溪坎边摇了摇头。今日既然先走了另一条山径，谷底脚夫以为巡山队封山，早已撤空窝点，连灯油都没留下半滴。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回总图 (0:02)|MP NPC Ash Loop]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<if _freshAshValley is 1>>
<<mpbargainicon>><<link [[拿路标换干松柴 (0:12)|MP NPC Ash Loop Resolve]]>><<pass 12>><<if !$daily.mpAshLoopValAct>><<set $daily.mpAshLoopValAct to 1>><<tiredness 1>><<set _npc.firewood += 1>><<set _npc.axis to Math.max(0, (_npc.axis or 0) - 2)>><<mpalert 2>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[查验火盆不沾私货 (0:14)|MP NPC Ash Loop Resolve]]>><<pass 14>><<if !$daily.mpAshLoopValAct>><<set $daily.mpAshLoopValAct to 1>><<tiredness 2>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, (_npc.axis or 0) + 3)>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><</link>>
<<else>>
<<walkicon>><<link [[查看封锁代价 (0:06)|MP NPC Ash Loop Lockout]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP NPC Ash Loop Lockout [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcAsh>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>>
岔口那块半埋的界石被山风磨得发亮，阿什没有收笔，而是蹲下去用掌心把松动的石基重新压稳。他让你把手贴在石面上，说风从哪边来，石头就先凉哪一边：高坡的风硬，谷底的风湿，选走一条，另一侧的风纹当天就再也读不出来。他从怀里抽出三根染黑的麻线，分别系在界石的三个棱角上，线头被风扯向不同方向，今夜只看哪根先断，明早就知道哪条山径先开。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回巡林总图 (0:02)|MP NPC Ash Loop]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[顺风记下界石纹 (0:05)|MP NPC Ash Deep Hub]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Ash Loop Resolve [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcAsh>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>>
<<set _wk to Math.floor(Time.days / 7)>>
一趟巡林下来，靴筒沾满松针与泥水。当前所走的是<<if _npc.patrolRoute is "north">>北岭风口<<elseif _npc.patrolRoute is "valley">>深谷暗哨<<else>>断桥旧道<</if>>，火种刻度 <<print _npc.axis>>，干柴 <<print _npc.firewood>> 份，余烬残页 <<print _npc.emberPages>> 页。<<if _npc.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守林人<</if>>把收集到的干松枝捆扎结实，看你要当场收拢入库还是转去营地搭建。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回火种深枢 (0:02)|MP NPC Ash Deep Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[收拢干柴入库 (0:10)|MP NPC Ash Deep Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<if !$daily.mpLoopSettleAsh>><<set $daily.mpLoopSettleAsh to 1>><<if (_npc.weekKey or -1) isnot _wk>><<set _npc.weekKey to _wk>><<set _npc.emberPages to Math.min(6, (_npc.emberPages or 0) + 1)>><</if>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 230 or ($tending or 0) gte 230 or _npc.axis gte 20>><<set _npc.firewood += ($mpWorldAshEnding is "hidden" ? 1 : 2)>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, _npc.axis + 4)>><<stress -3>><<else>><<set _npc.firewood += 1>><<tiredness 2>><</if>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<shopicon>><<link [[扛干柴去营地扩建 (0:06)|MP NPC Ash Subsys]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Ash Subsys [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcAsh>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>>
林间空地中央立着你们一点点搭起的营地：当前为<<if _npc.campTier gte 3>>三阶隐秘哨所，望台与暗格一应俱全<<elseif _npc.campTier gte 2>>二阶烘干木棚，雨天也能存住干柴<<elseif _npc.campTier gte 1>>一阶防风火塘，石圈挡住了贴地寒风<<else>>零阶荒地，还只有一圈黑石与烧剩的灰<</if>>。手里现有干燥薪柴 <<print _npc.firewood>> 份，每投两份就能把营地往上扩建一阶。
松针上的雨珠顺着树皮滑落，火塘里的余烬在山风里一明一暗。<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回火种深枢 (0:02)|MP NPC Ash Deep Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<shopicon>><<link [[投入干柴扩建 (0:15)|MP NPC Ash Subsys Upgrade]]>><<pass 15>><<if _npc.campTier lt 3 and _npc.firewood gte 2>><<set _npc.firewood -= 2>><<set _npc.campTier += 1>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, _npc.axis + 5)>><<else>><<stress 2>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[去林道筹集干薪柴 (0:04)|MP NPC Ash Loop]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Ash Subsys Upgrade [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcAsh>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>>
最后一块防风木板楔紧时，<<if _npc.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守林人<</if>>用手掌拍了拍梁柱试准承重。如今营地已升至<<if _npc.campTier gte 3>>三阶隐秘哨所<<elseif _npc.campTier gte 2>>二阶烘干木棚<<elseif _npc.campTier gte 1>>一阶防风火塘<<else>>初建火塘<</if>>，剩余干燥薪柴 <<print _npc.firewood>> 份。棚下留出了干爽的草垫与热茶壶，随时能供你们歇脚回神。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回火种深枢 (0:02)|MP NPC Ash Deep Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<shopicon>><<link [[回营地页查看 (0:02)|MP NPC Ash Subsys]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[靠在木棚烤火休整 (0:10)|MP NPC Ash Deep Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<if _npc.campTier gte 1>><<stress -4>><<tiredness -2>><<else>><<stress 1>><</if>><</link>>


:: MP NPC Ash Scene Morning [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcAsh>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<if $daily.mpAshScMorningFail>>
北岭兽径的盐霜还结着。<<if _npc.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守林人<</if>>摇头，说今天别再碰刮刀，手已经滑过一次。
松针落在石圈外，猎犬耳朵一动，风从北岭翻过来，带着湿土与松脂。松针落在石圈外，猎犬耳朵一动，风从北岭翻过来，带着湿土与松脂。<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回日程 (0:03)|MP NPC Ash Schedule]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[退回火塘 (0:05)|MP NPC Ash Deep Hub]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<<else>>
