<<getouticon>><<link [[退回日程 (0:03)|MP NPC Ash Schedule]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[报巡林口令 (0:10)|MP NPC Ash Schedule]]>><<pass 10>><<set $daily.mpAshScRepLow to 1>><<if (_npc.axis or 0) gte 25 or (_npc.trust or 0) gte 20>><<set _npc.deepStage to (_npc.deepStage or 0) + 1>><<set _npc.nextStepDay to Time.days + 1>><<set _npc.rep to Math.min(100, (_npc.rep or 50) + 4)>><<stress -1>><<else>><<set $daily.mpAshScRepLowFail to 1>><<set _npc.rep to Math.max(0, (_npc.rep or 50) - 6)>><<set _npc.firewood to Math.max(0, (_npc.firewood or 0) - 1)>><<stress 3>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[退让绕开 (0:08)|MP NPC Ash Schedule]]>><<pass 8>><<set $daily.mpAshScRepLow to 1>><<set _npc.deepStage to (_npc.deepStage or 0) + 1>><<set _npc.nextStepDay to Time.days + 1>><<set _npc.rep to Math.min(100, (_npc.rep or 50) + 1)>><<stress 1>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP NPC Ash Scene RepHigh [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcAsh>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
深谷脚夫把一捆干松枝撂在石圈外，说多亏你们拦过走私火器。<<if _npc.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守林人<</if>>看你，等你决定收不收。
松针落在石圈外，猎犬耳朵一动，风从北岭翻过来，带着湿土与松脂。<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回日程 (0:03)|MP NPC Ash Schedule]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<shopicon>><<link [[收下干柴 (0:08)|MP NPC Ash Schedule]]>><<pass 8>><<set $daily.mpAshScRepHigh to 1>><<set _npc.deepStage to (_npc.deepStage or 0) + 1>><<set _npc.nextStepDay to Time.days + 1>><<set _npc.firewood to (_npc.firewood or 0) + 1>><<set _npc.rep to Math.min(100, (_npc.rep or 50) + 2)>><<stress -2>><</link>><br>
<<mpscaleicon>><<link [[只记下人情 (0:08)|MP NPC Ash Schedule]]>><<pass 8>><<set $daily.mpAshScRepHigh to 1>><<set _npc.deepStage to (_npc.deepStage or 0) + 1>><<set _npc.nextStepDay to Time.days + 1>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, (_npc.axis or 0) + 2)>><<stress -1>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Ash Scene Finale [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcAsh>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<if $mpAshEnded>><<if $mpWorldAshEnding is "hidden">><<goto "MP NPC Ash Ending B">><<else>><<goto "MP NPC Ash Ending A">><</if>><</if>>
石洞口的分岔石阶前，整瓮老松脂油只够走一条路。<<if _npc.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守林人<</if>>把铜漏斗搁在瓮沿，看你：灌满北岭石塔，或砸毁引油槽改地下暗哨。选定就不能回头。北岭风从洞口灌进来，灯火一矮，猎犬在身后低吠，松针落在湿石上无声。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[先退回火塘 (0:04)|MP NPC Ash Deep Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><br>
<<mplampicon>><<link [[灌满北岭石塔 (0:20)|MP NPC Ash Ending A]]>><<pass 20>><<set $daily.mpAshScFinale to 1>><<set $mpAshIrreversibleChoice to "beacon">><<set $mpAshEnded to 1>><<set $mpWorldAshEnding to "beacon">><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, (_npc.axis or 0) + 10)>><</link>><br>
<<mpcellaricon>><<link [[砸槽改暗哨 (0:20)|MP NPC Ash Ending B]]>><<pass 20>><<set $daily.mpAshScFinale to 1>><<set $mpAshIrreversibleChoice to "hidden">><<set $mpAshEnded to 1>><<set $mpWorldAshEnding to "hidden">><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 8)>><</link>>


:: MP NPC Ash Ending A [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcAsh>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>>
<<if $mpAshEnded and $mpWorldAshEnding is "hidden">><<goto "MP NPC Ash Ending B">><</if>>
<<set _already to ($mpAshEnded or 0)>>
<<set $mpAshEnded to 1>><<set $mpWorldAshEnding to "beacon">><<set $mpAshIrreversibleChoice to "beacon">>
<<if !_already>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ash_ending_beacon_v50")>><<money 1600>><<set _npc.firewood to (_npc.firewood or 0) + 2>><</if>>
<<stress -10>><<trauma -4>>
<</if>>
赤红的松脂火苗顺着石槽轰然腾起，将北岭断崖照得亮如白昼。山下迷途的夜行人与进山采樵的街坊纷纷驻足仰望，第七盏灯终于在阔别多年后重新接上了全山灯网。<<if _npc.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守林人<</if>>站在火光侧影里，把写有你名字的铜牌挂上了主灯钩。高塔长明之后，每周都要多支一笔松脂油钱，三座低谷暗哨也就此废弃。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回火种深枢 (0:04)|MP NPC Ash Deep Hub]]>><<pass 4>><<stress -6>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[返回阿什身边歇息 (0:04)|MP NPC Ash Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Ash Ending B [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcAsh>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>>
<<if $mpAshEnded and $mpWorldAshEnding is "beacon">><<goto "MP NPC Ash Ending A">><</if>>
<<set _already to ($mpAshEnded or 0)>>
<<set $mpAshEnded to 1>><<set $mpWorldAshEnding to "hidden">><<set $mpAshIrreversibleChoice to "hidden">>
<<if !_already>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ash_ending_hidden_v50")>><<money 1600>><<set $mpLanternOil to ($mpLanternOil or 0) + 2>><</if>>
<<stress -10>><<trauma -4>>
<</if>>
山脊没有升起张扬的烽火，取而代之的是树根与岩缝间只有熟人能认出的七处低矮微光。林场巡查队再也抓不到夜行人的把柄，进山避祸的孤儿与旅人都有了干爽的暗哨可歇脚。<<if _npc.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守林人<</if>>把暗哨总图的孤本交到你手里，与你并肩退入林雾。自石塔砸封后，白昼高坡的干柴进项比从前少了一截。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回火种深枢 (0:04)|MP NPC Ash Deep Hub]]>><<pass 4>><<stress -6>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[返回阿什身边歇息 (0:04)|MP NPC Ash Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Ash Schedule [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcAsh>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<if Time.hour gte 6 and Time.hour lt 12>>晨雾还挂在北岭兽径上。<<if _npc.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守林人<</if>>蹲在界桩旁刮路标盐霜，猎犬在坡下巡一圈又折回来。松针落在靴边，湿土气味压过松脂，北岭风把铜牌刮得发凉。
<<elseif Time.hour gte 12 and Time.hour lt 18>>午后溪谷木棚里飘着松明味。<<if _npc.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守林人<</if>>正把油布绷在木架上，斧头搁在脚边。木屑粘在袖口，溪水声从坡下上来，棚顶漏进一道斜光。
<<else>>入夜后界石一带只剩防风灯。<<if _npc.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守林人<</if>>提着灯沿石圈慢慢走，靴底踩碎枯枝的声音很轻。灯晕外是黑松林，猎犬耳朵朝向深处，风从北岭翻过来。
<</if>>石圈外的火塘还留着余温，干柴码得整齐，油布册压在石台上。<<if $mpWorldAshEnding is "hidden">>暗哨改了夜巡钟点，白昼收柴少了一截。<<elseif $mpWorldAshEnding is "beacon">>北岭石塔的光在树梢上跳，每周多耗一笔松脂。<<else>>第七盏灯的位置还空着，册页边角被山风掀起。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回火塘 (0:02)|MP NPC Ash Deep Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<if Time.days lt (_npc.setback or 0)>>
<<walkicon>><<link [[看休整木牌 (0:04)|MP NPC Ash Quest Closed]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<elseif $mpAshEnded>>
<<if $mpWorldAshEnding is "hidden">><<link [[回暗哨终局 (0:08)|MP NPC Ash Ending B]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><<else>><<link [[回烽火终局 (0:08)|MP NPC Ash Ending A]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><</if>>
<<else>>北岭风把松针刮过石圈，猎犬耳朵一动，湿土气味压过松脂。
<<if Time.hour gte 6 and Time.hour lt 12 and !$daily.mpAshScMorning>><<walkicon>><<link [[跟他刮盐霜 (0:15)|MP NPC Ash Scene Morning]]>><<pass 15>><</link>><br>
<<elseif Time.hour gte 12 and Time.hour lt 18 and !$daily.mpAshScCreek>><<shopicon>><<link [[进木棚帮劈柴 (0:15)|MP NPC Ash Scene Creek]]>><<pass 15>><</link>><br>
<<elseif (Time.hour gte 18 or Time.hour lt 6) and !$daily.mpAshScNight>><<mplampicon>><<link [[沿界石巡夜 (0:15)|MP NPC Ash Scene Night]]>><<pass 15>><</link>><br>
<<elseif !$daily.mpAshScFire>><<socialiseicon>><<link [[火塘边歇脚 (0:10)|MP NPC Ash Scene Fire]]>><<pass 10>><</link>><br>
<<else>><<walkicon>><<link [[沿兽径走走 (0:08)|MP NPC Ash Street 5]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><br>
<</if>>
<<if (_npc.deepStage or 0) gte 5 and (_npc.emberPages or 0) gte 6 and !$mpAshEnded and !$daily.mpAshScFinale and Time.days gte (_npc.nextStepDay or 0)>><<mpscaleicon>><<link [[上北岭分岔口 (0:16)|MP NPC Ash Scene Finale]]>><<pass 16>><</link>>
<<elseif (_npc.emberPages or 0) gte 6 and !$daily.mpAshScEm6 and Time.days gte (_npc.nextStepDay or 0)>><<mplettericon>><<link [[摊齐六页余烬 (0:15)|MP NPC Ash Scene Ember6]]>><<pass 15>><</link>>
<<elseif ((_npc.love or 0) gte 40 or (_npc.trust or 0) gte 40) and !$daily.mpAshScRel40 and Time.days gte (_npc.nextStepDay or 0)>><<mphearticon>><<link [[跟他回树屋 (0:20)|MP NPC Ash Scene Rel40]]>><<pass 20>><</link>>
<<elseif (_npc.rep or 50) lt 30 and !$daily.mpAshScRepLow and Time.days gte (_npc.nextStepDay or 0)>><<mpeavesdropicon>><<link [[应付巡哨盘问 (0:12)|MP NPC Ash Scene RepLow]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<<elseif (_npc.rep or 50) gte 70 and !$daily.mpAshScRepHigh and Time.days gte (_npc.nextStepDay or 0)>><<mphandshakeicon>><<link [[收下脚夫谢礼 (0:12)|MP NPC Ash Scene RepHigh]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<<elseif (_npc.emberPages or 0) gte 4 and !$daily.mpAshScEm4 and Time.days gte (_npc.nextStepDay or 0)>><<investigateicon>><<link [[去旧灯座辨油 (0:15)|MP NPC Ash Scene Ember4]]>><<pass 15>><</link>>
<<elseif ((_npc.love or 0) gte 25 or (_npc.trust or 0) gte 25) and !$daily.mpAshScRel25 and Time.days gte (_npc.nextStepDay or 0)>><<mphearticon>><<link [[并肩坐石圈 (0:14)|MP NPC Ash Scene Rel25]]>><<pass 14>><</link>>
<<elseif (_npc.emberPages or 0) gte 2 and !$daily.mpAshScEm2 and Time.days gte (_npc.nextStepDay or 0)>><<mplettericon>><<link [[对读两页残页 (0:12)|MP NPC Ash Scene Ember2]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<<elseif ((_npc.love or 0) gte 10 or (_npc.trust or 0) gte 10) and !$daily.mpAshScRel10 and Time.days gte (_npc.nextStepDay or 0)>><<mphearticon>><<link [[接他递来的热水 (0:12)|MP NPC Ash Scene Rel10]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<<else>><<mpclockworkicon>><<link [[核对关系阶位 (0:06)|MP NPC Ash Tier Action]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</if>>

:: MP NPC Ash Note [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcCross>><<mpInitNpcAsh>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>>
你来到火塘边时<<if _npc.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守林人<</if>>恰巧出巡未归，石台上压着一块刻字的桦树皮便条：<<if (_npc.axis or 0) gte 60>>『我去北坡查一趟暗桩，石窝背风处给你留了烤热的干粮和松脂火种，入夜掌灯时回来找我。』<<elseif (_npc.axis or 0) gte 25>>『我去溪边清理断枝，火塘底下埋了温水壶，申时或入夜在营地见。』<<else>>『进山巡路，勿往深雾处走，傍晚归营。』<</if>>
松针上的雨珠顺着树皮滑落，火塘里的余烬在山风里一明一暗。<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回作息 (0:02)|MP NPC Ash Schedule]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mplettericon>><<link [[添柴留字条 (0:06)|MP NPC Ash Deep Hub]]>><<pass 6>><<if !$daily.mpAshNoteSign>><<set $daily.mpAshNoteSign to 1>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, (_npc.axis or 0) + 2)>><<stress -1>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[前往同城交集 (0:06)|MP NPC Cross Ash Hub]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Ash Street 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcAsh>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>>
林缘界石与镇外土路的交界处飘着细碎冷雨，<<if _npc.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守林人<</if>>正蹲在界石旁给指路木牌补刷防潮桐油，猎犬安静地卧在他的靴边。当前火种刻度为 <<print _npc.axis>>：<<if (_npc.axis or 0) gte 40>>猎犬一见你就摇着尾巴迎上来，他顺手把热油刷递给你一半<<else>>他抬头确认是你，指了指路边背风的树根让你避雨<</if>>。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回上一页 (0:02)|MP NPC Ash Schedule]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mprepairicon>><<link [[蹲下扶正界石 (0:10)|MP NPC Ash Deep Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<if !$daily.mpNpcStreetAsh>><<set $daily.mpNpcStreetAsh to 1>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, (_npc.axis or 0) + 2)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>><<stress -2>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpdogicon>><<link [[牵猎犬巡一段林道 (0:12)|MP NPC Ash Loop]]>><<pass 12>><<if !$daily.mpNpcStreetAsh>><<set $daily.mpNpcStreetAsh to 1>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>><<tiredness 3>><<stress -1>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Ash Daily 15 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcAsh>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>>
火塘旁的小铁罐里文火熬着加了蜂蜡的老松脂膏，苦冽的松香压住了林间湿气。当前火种刻度为 <<print _npc.axis>>：<<if (_npc.axis or 0) gte 35>><<if _npc.hasMet>>阿什<<else>>守林人<</if>>把最纯的头道脂膏分装进一只小铜盒塞进你兜里，说夜里擦在灯芯上连暴风都吹不灭<<else>>他教你怎样用木片刮净浮渣，免得装罐后受潮起泡<</if>>。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回关系阶位 (0:02)|MP NPC Ash Tier Action]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mphiveicon>><<link [[守火候撇净浮渣 (0:10)|MP NPC Ash Deep Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<if !$daily.mpNpcDailyAsh15>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyAsh15 to 1>><<set _npc.axis to Math.min(100, (_npc.axis or 0) + 2)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>><<stress -1>><<tiredness 1>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mplampicon>><<link [[把脂膏趁热封铜盒 (0:08)|MP NPC Ash Deep Hub]]>><<pass 8>><<if !$daily.mpNpcDailyAsh15>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyAsh15 to 1>><<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 2)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>><<stress -2>><<tiredness 1>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><</link>>
